-- The bug: this module is NOT the compile entry (it is auto-discovered via
-- MARCH_LIB_PATH), so its `alias` used to be dropped by lower_mod_decls'
-- catch-all, leaving `T.answer` -> `_T.answer` undefined at link time while
-- the definition was emitted as `AcBase.Target.answer`.
mod AcCaller do
  alias AcBase.Target as T
  fn go() do
    T.answer()
  end
end
